---
// "Ask Brightyard" preset-answer assistant.
---
<button class="astb mag" id="astb" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="astp"><i class="live"></i><span>Ask Brightyard</span></button>
<div class="ast" id="astp" role="dialog" aria-label="Chat assistant">
<header><span>Brightyard assistant<br><small>Preset answers</small></span><button id="astx" aria-label="Close" style="background:none;border:none;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)">&times;</button></header>
<div class="msgs" id="msgs" aria-live="polite"><div class="m b">Hi. I can answer a few quick questions about Brightyard. What would you like to know?</div></div>
<div class="qr" id="qr"><button data-q="services">What do you offer?</button><button data-q="products">What are Allocivo and Xessly?</button><button data-q="start">How fast can we start?</button><button data-q="price">How is pricing set?</button><button data-q="book">Book a call</button></div>
</div>
